FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">관심있는 학생들의 많은 참여 </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">바랍니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></strong></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><!--StartFragment--><font color=\"#000000\"></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">가</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">장학 과정 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">하계어학과정</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(Ulpan), </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">학위과정</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">연구과정</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">나</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">장학 조건</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">부분장학금은 의료보험료와 등록금 또는 생활비 지급</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">학위 과정중 일년</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">총 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">8</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">개월간 지급</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">전액장학금은 의료보험료</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">등록금</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">생활비 모두 지급</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">숙박비</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">교통비</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">항공료 등은 본인 부담</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">장학금 지급조건은 이스라엘 정부 예산사정에 따라 매년 달라질 수 있음</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 4) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">이스라엘 정부가 지정한 대학에 지원하는 경우에만 장학금이 지급됨</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">각 대학별로 장학금 지급이 다를 수 있으므로 확인 바람</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 